  Title: Mezzanotte & Magia
  TitleKey: 
  SubTitle: "Contrasti \u2022 Dinamica \u2022 Timbro"
  SubTitleKey: 
  Type: 0
  ProfilingData: {fileID: 0}
  Questions:
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: 'Contrasto (Ballo vs. Mezzanotte): Quale coppia mostra meglio il contrasto
        musicale?'
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: "Corretto! Le scene magiche scintillano (celesta/arpa),
      la mezzanotte \xE8 pi\xF9 scura/pesante (archi gravi, campane)."
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Celesta brillante & archi leggeri vs. archi gravi e campane tubolari
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Ottoni forti vs. ottoni ancora pi\xF9 forti"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Flauto vs. ottavino (stessa melodia, stessa sensazione)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Triangolo vs. tamburello (stesso pattern ripetuto)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: 'Dinamica (rintocchi di mezzanotte): quale andamento dinamico descrive
        la paura che cresce?'
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: "Corretto! Un colpo forte segna il rintocco; l\u2019urgenza
      cresce con crescendo e accenti."
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Colpo improvviso forte seguito da un crescendo mentre inizia la corsa
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Sempre piano e calmo
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Forte/piano a caso senza schema
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Solo diminuendo fino al silenzio
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Timbro (Magia): Quale colore sonoro segnala pi\xF9 chiaramente magia/trasformazione?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto! Celesta e arpa creano un colore scintillante
      e magico in Cenerentola.
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Tuba + gran cassa in marcia
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Tromboni con sordina
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Bordone di viola sola
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Celesta con arpa scintillante
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Musica\u2013Movimento (Mezzanotte): Quale azione scenica si abbina meglio
        ai rintocchi + polso pi\xF9 veloce?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: "Corretto! I rintocchi avvertono; il polso accelera
      \u2192 i personaggi si bloccano e poi scappano."
    MaxChoices: 1
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Inchino lento
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 1
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Congelamento, sguardo all\u2019orologio, uscita/corsa veloce"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Lunghi giri di valzer dolci
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Tableau immobile senza movimento
